BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026, Chris Rorden (BrowserQC); Node packaging by Neurodesk.

Segmentation runs @brainchop/mindgrab 0.1.20260925 (MIT): the MindGrab brain mask
and the MindMap, MindSnap and 18-class MeshNet models, with their weights compiled
into the WebAssembly modules. Quality metrics run niimath 1.4.20260928 (BSD-2-Clause)
compiled to WebAssembly by @niivue/niimath. See app/node_modules in a portable archive
for their licenses.

The MNI air template avg152T1.nii.gz is pinned by SHA-256 in src/pipeline.js.

